---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Img from '../components/Img.astro';
import { bio, saturnArt } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="About" description={bio.short}>
  <PageHero eyebrow="About" title="LJ Bey" mandala="mandala-root" tint="#fde4dc" />
  <div class="wrap mt-10 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr] items-start">
    <div class="prose-body">
      <p>{bio.long}</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl mt-10 mb-3">Born on Saturn</h2>
      <p>LJ Bey previously released music as Born on Saturn and as Jax.</p>
      <p>The Saturn identity is personal: Capricorn Moon and Capricorn Ascendant, and in the D9 chart, Aquarius Moon and Aquarius Ascendant. Saturn rules both signs.</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl mt-10 mb-3">From the archive</h2>
      <p>The mixtape Ascension and the Born on Saturn material are not on streaming platforms. They remain unreleased, part of the archive.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="orbit-float melt"><Img src={saturnArt} alt="Saturn, the lead Planet Head" class="w-full h-auto" eager sizes="(min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" /></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
